# What `vercel deploy` must not upload. The CLI does not read .gitignore:
# without this file it sends every local file except a short built-in list.
# The site takes its settings from the Vercel project's environment variables.

# Notes about the client project and the build records (outside git too)
/raw
/wiki
/.autopilot
/.claude
/LLM wiki prompt.md

# Local settings and secrets
.env
.env.*

# Local databases, uploads, backups and handover recordings
*.db
/media
/backups
/handover
/content/images
/*.png
